OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of having IRA manual
OL,4,Aon phone appears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with terrorism offences after
OL,8,Fhe was allegedly found with an IRA
OL,9,Fmanual on his mobile phone.
OL,11,FJac Glyn Edwards from Barmouth,
OL,12,FGwynedd, is charged with four counts of
OL,13,Fpossessing a record containing
OL,14,Finformation useful to terrorism.
OL,16,FIt is alleged that Edwards was found
OL,17,Fwith four documents which would likely
OL,18,Fbe useful to a person committing or
OL,19,Fpreparing an act of terrorism, the
OL,20,Fcharges state.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
