OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of having IRA manual
OL,4,Aon phone appears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Christopher Amis told a
OL,7,Fpreliminary hearing at the Old Bailey
OL,8,Fon Friday that this material allegedly
OL,9,Fincluded an IRA manual and a manual of
OL,10,Furban guerrilla warfare.
